### Agent Function History API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/agent-function-history
@agentTrackingId = AGENT_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@functionTrackingId = FUNCTION_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new function history
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "functionTrackingId": "{{functionTrackingId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59",
  "assignmentType": "PERMANENT",
  "notes": "Assigned to new function"
}

### 2. Update function history (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "functionTrackingId": "{{functionTrackingId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59",
  "assignmentType": "PERMANENT",
  "notes": "Updated notes"
}

### 3. Get specific function history record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all functions for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}

### 5. Get history by function (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/function/{{functionTrackingId}}

### 6. Get by start date range (Path Variables)
GET {{baseUrl}}/start-date-range/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 7. Get current function for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}/current

### 8. Get all function history records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 9. Delete function history record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
